</head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><header class="site-header" data-site-header><div class="site-header__inner shell"><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot"></a><nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/" aria-current="page">Services</a><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a></nav><a class="button button--primary header-cta" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a><button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-controls="mobile-navigation" aria-expanded="false" data-menu-toggle><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div></header><nav id="mobile-navigation" class="mobile-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation" hidden data-mobile-nav><div class="shell mobile-nav__inner"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/" aria-current="page">Services</a><div class="mobile-nav__services" role="group" aria-label="Service areas"><a href="/services/software-ai-business-systems/">Software, AI &amp; Business Systems</a><a href="/services/web-mobile-digital-growth/">Web, Mobile &amp; Digital Growth</a><a href="/services/cloud-security-it-operations/">Cloud, Security &amp; IT Operations</a></div><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div></nav><script type="module">var e=document.querySelector(`[data-menu-toggle]`),t=document.querySelector(`[data-mobile-nav]`);if(e instanceof HTMLButtonElement&&t instanceof HTMLElement){let n=[document.querySelector(`.skip-link`),document.querySelector(`main`),document.querySelector(`footer`)].filter(e=>e instanceof HTMLElement),r=e=>{n.forEach(t=>{t.inert=e})},i=(n=!1)=>{let i=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,`false`),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!0,document.body.classList.remove(`menu-open`),r(!1),n&&i&&e.focus()};e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{let n=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)!==`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,String(n)),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,n?`Close navigation menu`:`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!n,document.body.classList.toggle(`menu-open`,n),r(n)}),t.querySelectorAll(`a`).forEach(e=>e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>i())),document.addEventListener(`keydown`,n=>{if(n.key===`Escape`&&i(!0),n.key===`Tab`&&e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`){let r=[e,...t.querySelectorAll(`a`)],i=r[0],a=r.at(-1);n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===i?(n.preventDefault(),a?.focus()):!n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===a&&(n.preventDefault(),i.focus())}}),window.matchMedia(`(min-width: 960px)`).addEventListener(`change`,e=>{e.matches&&i()})}</script><main id="main-content"><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell page-hero__grid"><div class="page-hero__copy"><p class="eyebrow">Services</p><h1>Technology services organised around the problem you need to solve.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">Our portfolio spans business systems, customer-facing digital services and technology operations. We agree the problem to solve, the people involved, the deliverables and how success will be checked.</p><a class="button button--primary page-hero__action" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div><div class="page-hero__graphic"><svg class="arc-graphic arc-graphic--compact" viewBox="0 0 620 620" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="M598 76C400 76 238 184 238 316s162 228 360 228" opacity=".16"></path><path d="M598 116C426 116 286 205 286 316s140 188 312 188" opacity=".24"></path><path d="M598 158C454 158 337 228 337 316s117 146 261 146" opacity=".38"></path><path d="M598 201C485 201 392 252 392 316s93 103 206 103" opacity=".62"></path><path d="M598 245C516 245 448 277 448 316s68 60 150 60"></path><path d="M83 316H448" opacity=".5"></path></g><circle cx="448" cy="316" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="service-lanes-title" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg><div class="shell" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg><h2 id="service-lanes-title" class="visually-hidden" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Services</h2><div class="lane-grid" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg><article class="lane-card" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg><span class="ledger-number" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>01</span><h2 data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Software, AI &amp; Business Systems</h2><p data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Connect workflows, data and decisions across the business. Custom software, Odoo and other business systems, data integration, reporting and carefully scoped AI automation.</p><div class="lane-card__trigger" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg><h3 data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Typical trigger</h3><p data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>People repeatedly enter the same information, systems do not agree, or teams cannot see the current state of work.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/services/software-ai-business-systems/" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Explore software, AI and business systems</a></article><article class="lane-card" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg><span class="ledger-number" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>02</span><h2 data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Web, Mobile &amp; Digital Growth</h2><p data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Improve the digital services customers and teams use. Relevant work can include web and mobile products, ecommerce, customer portals, performance, technical SEO (helping search engines find and understand your website), analytics and measured digital improvement.</p><div class="lane-card__trigger" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg><h3 data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Typical trigger</h3><p data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>A customer journey is slow, confusing, unreliable, difficult to measure or no longer supports the service.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/services/web-mobile-digital-growth/" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Explore web, mobile and digital growth</a></article><article class="lane-card" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg><span class="ledger-number" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>03</span><h2 data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Cloud, Security &amp; IT Operations</h2><p data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Improve visibility, resilience and control across cloud, infrastructure, backup, recovery and support. We agree which systems to review, what checks are included and what the findings can tell you. If specialist testing is needed, we will explain that next step.</p><div class="lane-card__trigger" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg><h3 data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Typical trigger</h3><p data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Incidents repeat, ownership is unclear, costs are difficult to explain or the business is uncertain how it would recover.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/services/cloud-security-it-operations/" data-astro-cid-7a6hbtlg>Explore cloud, security and IT operations</a></article></div></div></section><section class="closing-cta"><svg class="arc-graphic arc-graphic--compact closing-cta__arc" viewBox="0 0 620 620" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="M598 76C400 76 238 184 238 316s162 228 360 228" opacity=".16"></path><path d="M598 116C426 116 286 205 286 316s140 188 312 188" opacity=".24"></path><path d="M598 158C454 158 337 228 337 316s117 146 261 146" opacity=".38"></path><path d="M598 201C485 201 392 252 392 316s93 103 206 103" opacity=".62"></path><path d="M598 245C516 245 448 277 448 316s68 60 150 60"></path><path d="M83 316H448" opacity=".5"></path></g><circle cx="448" cy="316" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg><div class="shell closing-cta__inner"><h2>You do not need to diagnose the technology first.</h2><p>Tell us what is happening, who it affects and what consequence it creates. We will help identify the decision before discussing a service.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="shell footer-grid" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="footer-brand" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if></a><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support software, systems and digital services.</p></div><div class="footer-links" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Work</h2><a href="/services/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Services</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Company</h2><a href="/events/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>How We Work</a><a href="/about/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>About</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</h2><a href="/contact/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Legal</h2><a href="/privacy-policy/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Terms</a></div></div></div><div class="shell footer-legal" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>© 2026 NOVADOT LTD. Registered in England and Wales. Company number 07691369.</p></div></footer></body></html>